1
00:00:22,799 --> 00:00:26,683
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,083 --> 00:00:33,698
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,571 --> 00:00:40,709
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,047 --> 00:00:47,056
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,267 --> 00:00:51,188
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:54,490
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,787 --> 00:00:59,022
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,007 --> 00:01:03,915
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,213 --> 00:01:07,099
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:12,191
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,191 --> 00:01:16,771
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,771 --> 00:01:18,770
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,973 --> 00:01:24,755
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,139 --> 00:01:29,450
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,450 --> 00:01:31,958
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,204 --> 00:01:42,421
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,871 --> 00:01:48,705
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,705 --> 00:01:51,623
=Episode 15=

19
00:01:52,239 --> 00:01:53,239
Suzhen, Qing,

20
00:01:53,359 --> 00:01:54,359
protect Aunt.

21
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:55,840
Fahai and I will clear a path.

22
00:01:56,079 --> 00:01:57,079
Hold on.

23
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,599
Stay and protect Suzhen and Aunt.

24
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,519
With his so-so skills,

25
00:02:00,519 --> 00:02:01,519
I'd better do it.

26
00:02:20,479 --> 00:02:21,479
Watch out!

27
00:02:30,439 --> 00:02:31,560
If you want them to live,

28
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,560
come with me quietly.

29
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,280
Forget about me. Protect Aunt.

30
00:02:41,599 --> 00:02:42,599
Suzhen!

31
00:02:42,599 --> 00:02:43,599
Aunt is the priority.

32
00:03:01,159 --> 00:03:02,240
A mere mortal like you,

33
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:04,039
and you think you can catch me?

34
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,360
You've finally dropped the act.

35
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:08,560
So you are indeed after me.

36
00:03:08,879 --> 00:03:10,520
Of course I'm after you,

37
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,080
snake demon.

38
00:03:14,039 --> 00:03:15,039
You know?

39
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,479
You're not Changming. You're a demon.

40
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:22,240
Enough talk.

41
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,800
Right here's fine.

42
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:39,039
This place is secluded.

43
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,759
The pursuers will take a while.

44
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:42,159
We can rest a bit.

45
00:03:47,639 --> 00:03:48,680
Fahai, Qing,

46
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,639
take care of Aunt.

47
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,000
I'm saving Suzhen now.

48
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,360
No need.

49
00:04:00,319 --> 00:04:01,680
Suzhen is blessed with luck.

50
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,080
She'll be fine.

51
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:12,159
Miss Bai is beautiful and kind.

52
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,599
The Buddha will protect her.

53
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,240
Xu Xian, don't worry.

54
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,160
How can I not go?

55
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:18,439
Miss Bai is just a mortal.

56
00:04:18,879 --> 00:04:20,399
How could she take Changming's torture?

57
00:04:21,079 --> 00:04:22,240
If I'm any later,

58
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:24,360
I can't imagine what state she'll be in.

59
00:04:24,639 --> 00:04:26,519
It's not certain who's torturing who.

60
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:29,519
What do you mean?

61
00:04:33,879 --> 00:04:36,720
Why would Changming
capture Miss Bai? Right?

62
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,120
Obviously, she's bait

63
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:39,399
to lure you into a trap.

64
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:41,240
His target is you.

65
00:04:41,879 --> 00:04:44,519
He probably won't hurt Miss Bai for now.

66
00:05:03,079 --> 00:05:04,079
What are you doing?

67
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:06,199
Use your head, will you?

68
00:05:06,519 --> 00:05:08,279
Ringing that bell now
will only expose us

69
00:05:08,759 --> 00:05:10,480
and put Aunt in danger again.

70
00:05:20,279 --> 00:05:21,360
What we need to do now

71
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,920
is check Aunt's injuries

72
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,079
and get some rest ourselves.

73
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,680
Qing.

74
00:05:42,839 --> 00:05:43,920
Is that all you've got?

75
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,720
I thought you'd be tougher.

76
00:05:53,279 --> 00:05:55,600
(No, I can't go back like this.)

77
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:22,000
I took a wrong turn.

78
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,600
Get back here.

79
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:30,439
I-I-I don't know how

80
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,279
I offended you, miss.

81
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:37,600
You look pretty clever.

82
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:41,120
Miss, I-I-I'd be a terrible meal.

83
00:06:41,639 --> 00:06:42,639
I'm tough when raw,

84
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,199
won't soften either way,

85
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,759
and taste awful.

86
00:06:46,279 --> 00:06:50,279
How about I find you
a tastier one, alright?

87
00:06:51,199 --> 00:06:52,199
I'm not hungry.

88
00:06:52,639 --> 00:06:54,879
I just need a favor from you.

89
00:06:56,639 --> 00:06:57,639
A favor?

90
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,680
Come here.

91
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,399
I'm not coming.

92
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,480
Come here.

93
00:07:18,497 --> 00:07:21,779
(Myriad Demons House)

94
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:29,560
It's the lord's handwriting.

95
00:07:37,735 --> 00:07:39,413
(Myriad Demons House)

96
00:07:45,319 --> 00:07:47,319
Let's go. Miss Bai is locked up.

97
00:07:47,519 --> 00:07:48,519
Wait.

98
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,040
What if it's a trap?

99
00:07:53,399 --> 00:07:54,439
Trap or not, I'm going.

100
00:07:55,279 --> 00:07:56,600
Miss Bai was taken because of me.

101
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,040
I can't just stand by.

102
00:07:58,079 --> 00:08:00,439
Alright, let me hide Aunt first.

103
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:04,079
What's with this?

104
00:08:04,319 --> 00:08:05,639
Why is everyone so hasty?

105
00:08:05,639 --> 00:08:07,160
I have to hide Aunt first, don't I?

106
00:08:07,519 --> 00:08:08,519
Wait for me.

107
00:08:20,879 --> 00:08:22,600
How long is this going to take?

108
00:08:23,199 --> 00:08:25,480
I should've come back later.

109
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:45,759
Suzhen's ruse is really something.

110
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,960
She could totally defeat Changming.

111
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,960
Why would she stir up all this drama?

112
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,200
What do you know?

113
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:55,000
This is called a hero saving the beauty.

114
00:08:55,759 --> 00:08:56,799
Wait for us.

115
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,720
Suzhen!

116
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,399
Xu Xian, get out of here.

117
00:09:08,679 --> 00:09:09,679
It's a trap.

118
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:17,080
It took you so long.

119
00:09:24,519 --> 00:09:27,279
I thought you wouldn't dare
show up today.

120
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,200
Changming,

121
00:09:30,279 --> 00:09:32,039
what exactly do you want?

122
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:38,639
Xu Xian, you've foiled my plans
too many times.

123
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:42,120
Today, none of you are leaving.

124
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,320
You and what army?

125
00:09:45,639 --> 00:09:49,279
Young Master Xu, this wretch
is a disgrace to Jinshan Temple.

126
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,600
Leave him to me.

127
00:09:50,879 --> 00:09:51,879
You go save Miss Bai.

128
00:09:58,679 --> 00:10:01,559
A useless disciple
who can't even wield an artifact?

129
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,759
You're not leaving either.

130
00:10:12,559 --> 00:10:13,559
Xu Xian, look out!

131
00:10:37,559 --> 00:10:38,559
Are you alright?

132
00:10:38,639 --> 00:10:39,639
I was careless.

133
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:40,960
Just admit you lost.

134
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,960
No need for excuses.

135
00:10:48,559 --> 00:10:49,559
Look after Suzhen.

136
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:15,600
Let's go.

137
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:19,720
My lord,

138
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:23,200
my mission is complete.

139
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:33,440
Aunt is weak.

140
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,000
I'll take her home first.

141
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,240
I'll go with you.

142
00:11:40,399 --> 00:11:41,879
Suzhen, I'm coming with you too.

143
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,000
No, you don't.

144
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,039
You rest up first.

145
00:11:50,679 --> 00:11:52,080
If we leave the mural like this,

146
00:11:52,519 --> 00:11:53,600
it might stir more trouble.

147
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:55,799
I must tell my master

148
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,360
to seal the entrance.

149
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:58,840
Let's split up.

150
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:28,440
- You...
- You...

151
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,320
You go first.

152
00:12:32,639 --> 00:12:34,759
Maybe you should go first.

153
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,320
Miss Bai,

154
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:42,919
I'm sorry I put you through that
while saving Aunt.

155
00:12:43,639 --> 00:12:44,799
Thank you, on behalf of Aunt.

156
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:47,600
So, what did you want to say?

157
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:08,200
Miss Bai,

158
00:13:16,120 --> 00:13:18,080
I'm sorry you were frightened.

159
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,639
Go back and get some rest.

160
00:13:22,879 --> 00:13:25,879
Well, you should go rest too,
Young Master Xu.

161
00:13:45,759 --> 00:13:47,360
Call me if you need anything.

162
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:23,120
Suzhen, you never used
to stare at the mirror so much.

163
00:14:24,399 --> 00:14:25,399
Is it because of Xu Xian?

164
00:14:26,279 --> 00:14:29,159
Yes, I need to make him love me more.

165
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:34,320
Now that Aunt is rescued,

166
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:36,000
and Xu Xian has feelings for you,

167
00:14:36,519 --> 00:14:39,759
can we move forward
as the Goddess instructed?

168
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:47,200
Yes, so how do we move forward?

169
00:14:47,559 --> 00:14:49,159
According to mortal customs,

170
00:14:49,159 --> 00:14:50,399
it's marriage, of course.

171
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,919
Once you two are united

172
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,440
and pass the love trial,

173
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,799
you can ascend to immortality.

174
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:03,399
Right, once we achieve that,

175
00:15:03,759 --> 00:15:05,000
we can ascend to immortality.

176
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:09,360
Qing, thank you.

177
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:38,879
I never thought Changming
would use Jinshan Temple's name

178
00:15:38,879 --> 00:15:40,399
to commit evil deeds out there.

179
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:42,960
Luckily, you discovered it in time

180
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:44,639
and cleared Jinshan Temple's name.

181
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:48,080
You've done well.

182
00:15:54,559 --> 00:15:55,919
I dare not claim credit.

183
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:02,519
Master, there's likely more
to what Changming did.

184
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:04,919
I will investigate it further.

185
00:16:08,279 --> 00:16:10,799
Within the mural is its own world.

186
00:16:17,799 --> 00:16:21,320
Let those demons
live their lives inside.

187
00:16:23,279 --> 00:16:24,399
Cast the spell with me

188
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:26,480
and seal the entrance.

189
00:16:26,559 --> 00:16:27,559
- Yes.
- Yes.

190
00:16:58,180 --> 00:17:02,339
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

191
00:17:04,806 --> 00:17:09,184
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

192
00:17:10,727 --> 00:17:16,552
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

193
00:17:17,321 --> 00:17:21,788
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

194
00:17:24,653 --> 00:17:29,094
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

195
00:17:31,290 --> 00:17:36,020
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

196
00:17:37,232 --> 00:17:43,345
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

197
00:17:44,008 --> 00:17:49,790
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

198
00:17:49,790 --> 00:17:56,053
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

199
00:17:56,363 --> 00:18:02,722
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

200
00:18:02,893 --> 00:18:10,260
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

201
00:18:10,545 --> 00:18:16,092
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

202
00:18:16,583 --> 00:18:22,793
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

203
00:18:23,103 --> 00:18:29,876
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

204
00:18:30,873 --> 00:18:36,526
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

205
00:18:37,360 --> 00:18:41,768
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

206
00:18:42,533 --> 00:18:45,121
♪Having ever loved♪
